<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 10 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 10 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 10 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday showed a net selling stance of 2.1 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' buy orders totalled 22.0 million shares while sell orders amounted to 24.1 million.</p>
</text>
